proxy_cookie_domain $cognito_host $host;
}
}
Note
(Optional) If you choose to provision a dedicated coordinator node, it will automatically
start hosting OpenSearch Dashboards. As a result, the availability of data node resources
such as CPU and memory is increased. This increased availability of data node resources can
help to improve the overall resiliency of your domain.
